60927abd4b844bce4d134be465a6b7e4930992229dda2611"}, "selector": {"jsonPointer": "/files/157/description"}}, {"after": "| `package.json` | manifest | Coordinate explicit maintenance scripts without npm workspace hoisting; select npm11.13.0 with independent per-package locks and Node24.16.0. |", "before": "| `package.json` | manifest | Declare TypeScript workspace membership and common script names; package manager and its lockfile remain to be selected. |", "parent": {"bytes": 65207, "path": "docs/v2/architecture/14-repository-and-module-layout.md", "sha256": "c7b10bf6d0f98d196d4509c5b972cd87f4af27bf9a56b9ffe5a240f93ee6287e"}, "selector": {"line": 316}}, {"after": "Declare pinned browser report build dependencies: TypeScript6.0.3 and esbuild0.28.2, with native DOM modules and an offline self-contained deliverable.", "before": "Declare report build dependencies and scripts; frontend framework and bundler remain undecided.", "parent": {"bytes": 119982, "path": "docs/implementation/m1/repository-file-inventory.v8.json", "sha256": "c4a1242cb1ea15b260927abd4b844bce4d134be465a6b7e4930992229dda2611"}, "selector": {"jsonPointer": "/files/13/description"}}, {"after": "| `apps/report/package.json` | manifest | Declare pinned browser report build dependencies: TypeScript6.0.3 and esbuild0.28.2, with native DOM modules and an offline self-contained deliverable. |", "before": "| `apps/report/package.json` | manifest | Declare report build dependencies and scripts; frontend framework and bundler remain undecided. |", "parent": {"bytes": 65207, "path": "docs/v2/architecture/14-repository-and-module-layout.md", "sha256": "c7b10bf6d0f98d196d4509c5b972cd87f4af27bf9a56b9ffe5a240f93ee6287e"}, "selector": {"line": 550}}, {"after": "bytes require review. The later implementation bootstrap selects native DOM modules and esbuild", "before": "bytes require review. No frontend framework or bundler is selected", "parent": {"bytes": 65207, "path": "docs/v2/architecture/14-repository-and-module-