 address a is a+\".\"+i (zero-based, shortest decimal), and the operand of a not node at address a is a+\".0\".", "parent": {"bytes": 196987, "path": "docs/coop/design-corrections/foundation/identity-schemas.v3.json", "sha256": "a76c9e2f07e8f8e52ee611f157548f6a09061866308652e3a0f7e3c24893db21"}, "selector": {"jsonPointer": "/$defs/program-predicate/description"}}, {"after": "shortest ASCII decimal (`0` or `[1-9][0-9]*`), refusing non-ASCII digit spellings without normalization; the single operand of a `not` node at", "before": "shortest decimal without a leading zero; the single operand of a `not` node at", "parent": {"bytes": 135448, "path": "docs/v2/contracts/product-v1/identity-and-evidence.md", "sha256": "c82404f3a0cf56fa6cc02e99cc3ebbd5356fedc3b36aeb38f9ef284077fbd31f"}, "selector": {"line": 1272}}, {"after": "recipe. The selected predicate-matching-reference-selection-v1 `reference/workflows_model.v1.py::glob_match` corrects the historical literal-star mismatch and implements this predicate;", "before": "recipe. The reference `workflows_model.v1.glob_match` implements this predicate;", "parent": {"bytes": 3946, "path": "docs/coop/design-corrections/foundation/glob-pattern-contract.v1.md", "sha256": "9b12ef44aa84f597427c27a9d2bf94fd487fd7f96893971cd902f71fb1d68ba0"}, "selector": {"line": 79}}, {"after": "The closed record digested by predicate-witness.programPredicateDigest. It addresses ONE predicate node of the admitted RuleProgramV2; it introduces no second policy language. predicateId is the node address: the rule root is \"p\", the i-th operand of an and/or node at address a is a+\".\"+i (zero-based, shortest ASCII decimal 0 or [1-9][0-9]*; non-ASCII digits are refused, never normalized), and the operand of a not node at address a is a+\".0\".", "before": "The closed record digested by predicate-witness.programPredicateDigest. It addresses ONE predicate node of the admitted RuleProgramV2; it introduces no second policy language. predicateId is the node address: the rule root is \"p\", the i-th operand of an and/or node at address a is a+\".\"+i (zero-based, shortest decimal), and the operand of a not node at address a is a+\".0\".", "parent": {"bytes": 197480, "path": "docs/implementation/m1/source-selection-v2/schemas/sources/identity.v3.schema.json", "sha256": "311c1feb09ff8cd0b207233d2ec0d7440bb1c72fc0470de277ee1891c24bb68f"}, "selector": {"jsonPointer": "/$defs/program-predicate/description"}}], "selected": "docs/implementation/m2/predicate-matching-reference-selection-v2/successor.json", "sha256": "99df59c0b101f580461b358869831be8e85964cab43ed190dee0c4a18f7315a8"}, {"inputs": [{"bytes": 1418, "path": "docs/implementation/m2/native-runtime-selection-v10/README.md", "sha256": "569b4f797a858b3f3a3d7d8545155b02c408392fe6ca0026692c1d355ca706b7"}, {"bytes": 179, "path": "docs/implementation/m2/native-runtime-selection-v10/evidence/archive-pin.json", "sha256": "aec3e23d6d863a2e7d1679c88423c7ee2b5c54489e4039c4d8b88c3abb13c108"}, {"bytes": 411, "path": "docs/implementation/m2/native-runtime-selection-v10/evidence/base-recomposition.json", "sha256": "4c870acaafb1c8b2bc6a1ec5bf174fdd51e22b64ebb86320602795ff137efd36"}, {"bytes": 39412, "path": "docs/implementation/m2/native-runtime-selection-v10/evidence/baseline.json", "sha256": "fe56770b5e0cc547077fba5106d3b4ff307ea9de97f076158ed4241db5b6f979"}, {"bytes": 0, "path": "docs/implementation/m2/native-runtime-selection-v10/evidence/contracts-dependencies.stderr", "sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855"}, {"bytes": 624, "path": "docs/implementation/m2/native-runtime-selection-v10/evidence/contracts-dependencies.stdout", "sha256": "e1425a81ff8fc19081bedf9d00eda64ed9cc5f913ebd67884c5a593a61a7b6fb"}, {"bytes": 0, "path": "docs/implementation/m2/native-runtime-selection-v10/evidence/design.stderr", "sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855"}, {"bytes": 251379, "path": "docs/implementation/m2/native-runtime-selec